<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 3,640.50 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 3,640.50 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 3,640.50 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,600.50 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 10		  Nov 6</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,640.50		3,600.50</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
